  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: MediaData_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c44be01868450f048ab83991748e225e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 49749574639621
    m_Localized: "Hey, Dad! Remember that tea you liked at that little caf\xE9 near
      home? I got the recipe! Write this down: for one mug, you'll need one teaspoon
      of black tea, two slices of dried apple, and a pinch of cinnamon. Bring the
      water to a boil, then let it cool to 80\xB0C. Pour it over the tea and let
      it steep for five minutes. If you'd like it sweeter, don't add sugar. Use honey
      instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639620
    m_Localized: I finally got the last of the tomatoes planted. The old irrigation
      system decided it was raining again overnight, even though there wasn't a cloud
      in the sky. I'll have to clean the sensor tomorrow. Last year, I put it off
      for a week and ended up spending two days bailing water out of the greenhouse.
      Still, the first sprouts have appeared. I think we'll have a good harvest this
      year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639617
    m_Localized: May 15, 2066. The first case of deviant robot behavior was recorded
      yesterday morning. A domestic assistant robot from the HOMI-200 series made
      a mess of an apartment and refused to perform its primary functions. The deviant
      unit was scrapped, and all remaining HOMI-200 units were reprogrammed. Production
      oversight for the next batch of helper robots has been tightened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639616
    m_Localized: The district library reminds visitors that its home archive digitization
      service is now open on Wednesdays and Fridays. We accept audio cassettes, CDs,
      and floppy disks, as long as their contents can still be read. Please label
      your boxes. Thank you for helping us preserve historical records!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749532696576
    m_Localized: Good evening, North District! Today is November 2, 2064. City authorities
      have finished repairing the tram stop by the old botanical garden. The first
      tram will run on its regular schedule tomorrow, Monday. On Thursday, the district
      library will host a household electronics swap. Bring working radios, cassette
      players, and other devices that need a new home. Take care, and see you tomorrow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639619
    m_Localized: "July 5, 2062. Earth has been hit by an extreme heat wave, with
      temperatures reaching as high as 59\xB0C. The sharp rise in temperature has
      caused numerous fires, as well as severe overheating in robots whose systems
      were not adequately protected. New cooling system standards for domestic helper
      robots have been introduced to prevent a recurrence of this situation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639618
    m_Localized: October 31, 2053. According to medical research, 40% of the world's
      population now suffers from obesity, while life expectancy has fallen to 65
      years. The cause behind these figures is the fact that robots now perform all
      physical labor in the modern world, both in factories and in people's homes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639622
    m_Localized: '"August 10, 2051. Shopping list:

      Milk, sugar, eggs, cat
      food, cat treats, cream, sausage, tea.

      DO NOT FORGET THE CAT TREATS.

      He
      was mad at me last time."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639623
    m_Localized: Kate, guess what! We got so much snow today! There wasn't a single
      snowflake yesterday, and now there are huge snowdrifts everywhere! HOMI just
      tried to clear the path, but he only piled all the snow onto the porch, right
      in front of the door. Now he can't get in, and I can't get out... I have to
      explain to him through the window that clearing snow doesn't mean piling a
      huge snowdrift in front of the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639624
    m_Localized: Hi... We haven't seen each other in two years. When are you coming
      back? I miss you. So much has changed at home since you left. Mom has trouble
      walking now. I try to take care of all the housework, but it's so hard to manage
      on my own... Please come home. Even if it's just for a couple of days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639625
    m_Localized: '"URGENT NOTICE TO THE SECURITY DEPARTMENT

      An emergency has
      been reported in Workshop No. 12: the latest batch of helper robots has malfunctioned
      and gone on a rampage.

      Immediately cut power to all units in batch #1043."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749574639626
    m_Localized: '"July 6, 2065. Prototype Report - Development Department.

      System
      malfunctions have been detected in the latest SORTA prototype. The robot fails
      to retain information and violates sorting rules.

      The recognition system
      must be improved."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749578833920
    m_Localized: '"Good afternoon.

      I am submitting robot SPROUT-48 for disposal.

      According
      to the customer''s report, instead of taking care of plants, the robot began
      pulling them out of their pots and throwing them away.

      This unit cannot
      be reprogrammed."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749578833921
    m_Localized: '"January 3, 2053. Task list for the Repair Department:

      1.
      Replace the cassette reader in robot SORTER C-04.

      2. Order a shipment
      of new parts for the new HOMI-153 model.

      3. Send the latest batch of
      broken robots for disposal."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749578833922
    m_Localized: "Hey, C-04? I hope you'll hear it. These guys are from the archive\u2026
      They didn't tell you, did they? When you're done sorting, you'll be disposed
      of. There's not enough memory on the tape to tell you what to do. Call me:
      1735. I will help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49749578833923
    m_Localized: Northern District News Channel sticker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51882952843264
    m_Localized: Nothing on surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
